      "message": "This works but doesn\u0027t scale. Is it possible to support any number of length, more than 3? For example, put the led-color and the period definition in `child-binding`, like:\n    \n    power-state-discharge-s3 {\n        color-1 {\n            led-color \u003d \"LED_AMBER\";\n            period \u003d \u003c4\u003e\n        };\n        color-2 {\n            led-color \u003d \"LED_OFF\";\n            period \u003d \u003c4\u003e;\n        };\n    };\n    \nThe period is not necessary to be the same for all colors. For example, a device may uses a pattern: ON 1 second, OFF 3 seconds.",
